# Board XNU patches, one path per line in application order (patches/xnu/ of this repository).
#
# The sirius port currently changes nothing below the OS profile: the kernel behaviour it needs
# lives in the ARM64 series of UniXNU (4 KiB pages, native trust cache, the DT panic region,
# boot progress) and in its own sources (drivers/ArmCpu, drivers/DarwinBoot, package/).
# A board change goes here when it must be a patch; follow
# https://unixnu.com/xnu/source-and-patches#add-a-patch to export and order it.
sirius-usb-console.patch
sirius-skip-rootauth.patch
sirius-console-ring.patch
sirius-exec-trace.patch
